            <div class="zn-element zn-lg  ">
              <h3 id="" class="zn-heading "   ><p>Hurricane Helene damaged some 822,000 acres of timberland in Western North Carolina. In these open spaces, surprising bird species are finding room to roost — and maybe new threats.&nbsp;</p></h3>
